          "B": "If Adharshila Foundation has not been engaged in any reasonable \nactivity in its chosen field for the benefit of the society for one \nconsecutive year, the Certificate of Registration granted to it is liable \nto be cancelled after it has been given a reasonable opportunity of \nbeing heard.",
