        "explanation": "Refer section 455 of the Companies Act, 2013 read with Rule 3 of the \nCompanies (Miscellaneous) Rules, 2014, a company cannot be granted \ndormant status if any investigation, inquiry or inspection has been \ninitiated or is pending against the company"
