        "explanation": "Statutory Reference: Regulation 3(1) & Regulation 7(1) of SEBI (SAST) Regulations, 2011.\n• Initial Trigger [Reg 3(1)]: No acquirer shall acquire shares or voting rights in a target company which taken together with shares or voting rights, if any, held by him and by persons acting in concert with him in such target company, entitle them to exercise 25% or more of the voting rights in such target company unless the acquirer makes a public announcement of an open offer.\n• Minimum Offer Size [Reg 7(1)]: The open offer for acquiring shares under Regulation 3 or Regulation 4 shall be for at least 26% of total shares of the target company.",
        "examinerWarning": "Keep the two SAST percentages distinct: Initial Open Offer Trigger = 25% voting rights [Reg 3(1)]; Minimum Open Offer Size = 26% of total shares [Reg 7(1)]."
