        "correctOption": "B",
        "explanation": "Statutory Reference: Regulation 3(2) of SEBI (SAST) Regulations, 2011.\n• An acquirer who together with PACs holds shares or voting rights entitling them to exercise 25% or more of the voting rights, but less than the maximum permissible non-public shareholding (75%), shall not acquire within any financial year additional shares or voting rights entitling them to exercise more than 5% of the voting rights unless the acquirer makes a public announcement of an open offer.\n• Note: Gross acquisitions alone are considered without netting off any sales during the financial year.",
